	(text "Root sheet. Signal flow: Power -> Front End -> Slicer/LVDS -> Connector. No AGC loop and no detector sheet (decision 12).\nMonitor sheet buffers VCM_REF (1.65 V baseline) and the RSSI minimum detector from TIA_TAP; the Controller (ESP32-C6, decisions 11/12) sets\nDAC_TH/DAC_HV/HV_DIS/SHDN_N/LE_HYS/TIA_CTRL, reads HV_MON/RSSI/VTH_MON, and talks CAN through the Connector.\nStatus labels VERIFIED/PROPOSED/UNRESOLVED; no part values approved for fabrication."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 25.4 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "29c110a3-4bce-4013-8bfa-e2c16dd2073e")
	)
	(text "Rails +5V_CABLE (Connector -> Power), VBUS (Controller -> Power), 3V3, 3V3_D are sheet pins; +5V is internal to Power (U5 TPS2121 mux OUT, decision 13); PWR_SRC runs Power -> Controller; GND is global. HV_ nets and APD_BIAS are net class HV (1.0 mm clearance).\nLVDS_P is low for a logic one (post-amp non-inverting after an OPA857 whose OUT swings down with light); the FPGA inverts."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 25.4 35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f14213e0-caef-4976-a807-64f361eef091")
	)
